{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"454650","name":"DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2","type":"game","about_the_game":"属于你的故事、你的自创角、你的七龙珠世界──<br><br>《DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2》是一款动作魄力十足、战斗壮烈，并且具有无限自定义要素的七龙珠游戏。快到游戏内建立自创角探索“肯特都”，并与各个以老师身分登场的角色组队训练，挺身战斗，守护七龙珠的历史吧！<br>随着游戏的发展，将可以自由编辑角色的外表、能力、招式等内容，创造出充满个人特色的强大战士！<br>除此之外，《DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2》内还具有连机游玩模式，可跟世界各地的玩家展开史诗级的战斗，或是参加袭击头目战，一同对抗邪恶的敌人！<br>现在就前往持续更新带来新发现及新体验的肯特都吧！<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >属于你的战士</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454650/extras/5923f495f1997ea475e919006fecc236.poster.avif?t=1783463273\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454650/extras/5923f495f1997ea475e919006fecc236.webm?t=1783463273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454650/extras/5923f495f1997ea475e919006fecc236.mp4?t=1783463273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>可利用多样的自定义项目，创造出你原创的风格及个性的角色。设定种族、外观、能力甚至是招式，创造出你独一无二的战士吧。<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >无限的连机体验</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454650/extras/26e5f52ab0d4485e2a2d4d757c8dff99.poster.avif?t=1783463273\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454650/extras/26e5f52ab0d4485e2a2d4d757c8dff99.webm?t=1783463273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454650/extras/26e5f52ab0d4485e2a2d4d757c8dff99.mp4?t=1783463273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>可在连机游玩模式或游戏内的活动中体验无限战斗的快感！快来跟世界各地的玩家展开史诗级的战斗，或是参加袭击头目战，一同对抗邪恶的敌人吧！<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >燃烧斗志</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co